OL,3,GNEWSADrivers urged not to use cycle
OL,4,Apath 'shortcut' during roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been urged not to try to
OL,7,Fuse a cycle and walking path as a
OL,8,Fshortcut during a road closure in the
OL,9,Fsouth of Scotland.
OL,11,FThe A702 at Penpont is shut for
OL,12,Froadworks with an official alternative
OL,13,Froute signposted in the area.
OL,15,FKier, Penpont and Tynron Development
OL,16,FTrust (KPTDT) said it understood it was
OL,17,Fa "major headache" and added to travel
OL,18,Ftimes but said it was aware of
OL,19,Fmotorists trying to use the path to
OL,20,Fbypass the diversion.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
