OL,3,GNEWSADrivers urged not to use cycle
OL,4,Apath 'shortcut' during roadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it was designed for walking,
OL,7,Fcycling, mobility scooters, wheelchairs
OL,8,Fand prams and using it as a detour was
OL,9,Fputting vulnerable pedestrians,
OL,10,Fchildren and cyclists at "serious
OL,11,Frisk".
